The dish looks like a small bowl or side plate, about 15–18 cm across. It holds rigatoni or paccheri pasta in a creamy sauce with greens, red pepper flakes, and a breadcrumb topping.

The portion looks modest, about 5–6 large pasta pieces. I estimate roughly 170 g of cooked pasta with sauce. At about 1.6 kcal/g for creamy pasta, that comes to about 270 kcal. The cream or cheese sauce and breadcrumbs push it a little higher, so I'll say about 290 kcal.

